Package: sv-wordlists
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: z1rov <fabian@zirov.net>
Installed-Size: 15
Depends: svent-core, git, curl, ca-certificates
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Description: Svent wordlists (SecLists + rockyou + OneListForAll)
 Downloads SecLists, rockyou.txt and OneListForAll (micro/short) into
 /opt/lists for fuzzers and password crackers. Fetched at install time (~1.3GB).
